\'e0n x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp; t\'ednh to\'e1n x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh hi\u7879\'3fu qu\u7843\'3f s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh;
\par - T\'ednh tr\'edch v\'e0 h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n ch\'ednh x\'e1c s\u7889\'3f kh\u7845\'3fu hao t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\'e0o gi\'e1 th\'e0nh s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm ho\u7863\'3fc chi ph\'ed l\'fdu th\'f4ng, t\'ednh v\'e0 h\u7841
\'3fch to\'e1n k\u7883\'3fp th\u7901\'3fi gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f hao m}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f2n t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh. Gi\'e1m s\'e1t vi\u7879\'3fc tr\'edch n
\u7897\'3fp kh\u7845\'3fu hao c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn cho Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc, cho c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean v\'e0 ho\'e0n tr\u7843\'3f v\u7889\'3fn vay Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng theo ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh;
