\par - L\u7853\'3fp b\'e1o c\'e1o k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n v\u7873\'3f t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh, ph\'e2n t\'edch t}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ecnh h\'ecnh trang b\u7883\'3f, huy }{
