\par }{\b\f278\fs28\expnd4\expndtw24\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 4 - }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 T\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\u7843\'3fn \'e1nh tr\'ean s\u7893\'3f s\'e1ch v
\'e0 b\'e1o c\'e1o k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n theo nguy\'ean gi\'e1 (gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f ban \'f0\u7847\'3fu). Nguy\'ean gi\'e1 c\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh l\'e0 to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f c\'e1c ch\'ed ph\'ed li\'ean quan \'f0\u7871
\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng ho\u7863\'3fc mua s\u7855\'3fm t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh k\u7875\'3f c\u7843\'3f c\'e1c chi ph\'ed v\u7873\'3f v\u7853\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn, l\u7855\'3fp \'f0\u7863\'3ft v\'e0 chi ph\'ed ki
\u7871\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn kh\'e1c. Nguy\'ean gi\'e1 c\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh tr\u7915\'3f \'f0i gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f hao m}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f2n c\u7911\'3fa ch\'fang g
\u7885\'3fi l\'e0 gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f c\'f2n l\u7841\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f }{\f278\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh. Gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f c}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f2n l\u7841\'3fi c
\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh l\'e0 v\u7889\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh hi\u7879\'3fn c\'f3 c\u7911\'3fa x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp.
\par Nguy\'ean gi\'e1 t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh trong t\u7915\'3fng tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh nh\'fd sau:
\par - Nguy\'ean gi\'e1 c\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng, t\u7921\'3f ch\u7871\'3f t\u7841\'3fo ho\u7863\'3fc mua s\u7855\'3fm m\u7899\'3fi l\'e0 gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ghi t\'e3ng v\u7889\'3f
n c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh ph\u7843\'3fn \'e1nh trong b\'e1o c\'e1o quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n c\'f4ng tr}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ecnh ho\'e0n th\'e0nh }{\f278\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'e3 }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc duy\u7879\'3ft y.
\par - Nguy\'ean gi\'e1 c\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh nh\u7853\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn giao ho\u7863\'3fc mua l\u7841\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp, c\'f5 quan kh\'e1c l\'e0 nguy\'ean gi\'e1 ghi trong bi\'ean b
\u7843\'3fn giao nh\u7853\'3fn t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'e3 }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc duy\u7879\'3ft y, tr\u7915\'3f chi ph\'ed c\u361\'3f
 (n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3) v\u7873\'3f v\u7853\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn, l\u7855\'3fp \'f0\u7863\'3ft, ch\u7841\'3fy th\u7917\'3f..., c\u7897\'3fng chi ph\'ed m\u7899\'3fi (n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3) v\u7873\'3f v\u7853\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn, l\u7855\'3fp \'f0\u7863\'3f
t, ch\u7841\'3fy th\u7917\'3f... tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc khi d\'f9ng.
\par - Nguy\'ean gi\'e1 c\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'e3 }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'f0\'e1nh gi\'e1 l\u7841\'3fi theo quy\u7871\'3ft 
\'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc l\'e0 gi\'e1 m\u7899\'3fi t\'ednh trong \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ki\u7879\'3fn hi\u7879\'3fn t\u7841\'3fi (gi\'e1 kh\'f4i ph\u7909\'3fc) \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng cho vi\u7879\'3fc \'f0\'e1nh gi\'e1 l\u7841\'3fi t
\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh.}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid8272184 
\par }{\b\f278\fs28\expnd4\expndtw24\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 5 -}{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754  Nguy\'ean gi\'e1 c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883
\'3fnh ghi tr\'ean s\u7893\'3f s\'e1ch v\'e0 b\'e1o c\'e1o k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n kh\'f4ng thay \'f0\u7893\'3fi trong su\u7889\'3ft th\u7901\'3fi gian t\u7891\'3fn l\u7841\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi x\'ed
 nghi\u7879\'3fp, tr\u7915\'3f nh\u7919\'3fng tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp sau \'f0\'e2y:
\par 1. Trang b\u7883\'3f, \'f0\u7893\'3fi m\u7899\'3fi b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn l\'e0m t\'e3ng gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f c\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh.
\par 2. Th\'e1o b\u7899\'3ft m\u7897\'3ft v\'e0i b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh l\'e0m gi\u7843\'3fm gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh.
\par 3. \'d0\'e1nh gi\'e1 l\u7841\'3fi t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh theo quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid8272184 
\par }{\b\f278\fs28\expnd4\expndtw24\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 6 -}{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754  \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh cho b\'ean ngo\'e0i thu\'ea d\'e0i h\u7841
\'3fn, x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp cho thu\'ea v\u7851\'3fn ghi nguy\'ean gi\'e1 c\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh cho thu\'ea trong b\u7843\'3fng t\u7893\'3fng k\u7871\'3ft t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa m}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ecnh, c\'f2n x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0i thu\'ea ph\u7843\'3fi c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f ghi \u7903\'3f h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng \'f0\u7875\'3f
 ghi v\'e0o t\'e0i kh}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 o\u7843\'3fn ngo\'e0i b\u7843\'3fng t\u7893\'3fng k\u7871\'3ft t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn.
\par }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 N\u7871\'3fu x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0i thu\'ea t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh b\u7887\'3f v\u7889\'3fn x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng th\'eam, trang b\u7883\'3f th\'eam ho\u7863\'3fc \'f0\u7893\'3f
i m\u7899\'3fi m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh thu\'ea ngo\'e0i, theo s\u7921\'3f tho\u7843\'3f thu\u7853\'3fn trong h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng gi\u7919\'3fa \'f0\'f4i b
\'ean, th}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ec x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0i thu\'ea ph\u7843\'3fi h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n c\'f4ng}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754  tr\'ecnh x\'e2y d\u7921
\'3fng th\'eam, trang b\u7883\'3f th\'eam }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\'f3 v\'e0o t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp m}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ecnh v\'e0 ph
\u7843\'3fi ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh tr\'edch kh\u7845\'3fu hao.
\par }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 H\u7871\'3ft h\u7841\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng. x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0i thu\'ea giao tr\u7843\'3f t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh bao g\u7891\'3fm c\u7843\'3f c\'f4ng tr}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ecnh x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng th\'eam ho\u7863\'3fc }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\u7893\'3fi m\u7899\'3fi cho \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f cho thu\'ea. Khi giao nh\u7853\'3fn \'f0\'f4i b\'ean ghi s
\u7893\'3f theo nguy\'ean gi\'e1 v\'e0 s\u7889\'3f kh\u7845\'3fu hao c\u7911\'3fa ph\u7847\'3fn c\'f4ng tr}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ecnh x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng th\'eam ho\u7863\'3fc trang b\u7883\'3f th\'eam }{
\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\'f3 theo ph\'fd\'f5ng ph\'e1p k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n nh\'fd\u7907\'3fng b\'e1n t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh gi\u7919\'3fa hai x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp.}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid8272184 
\par }\pard \qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid6643205 {\b\f286\fs28\expnd5\expndtw28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 CH\'dd\'d5NG HAI\line T\u7892\'3f CH\u7912\'3fC K\u7870\'3f TO\'c1N T\'c0I S\u7842\'3fN C\u7888\'3f \'d0
