\u7843\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f cao cho ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh c\u7911\'3fa x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp. X\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp ph\u7843\'3fi ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7853\'3ft ch\u7845\'3ft v\'e0 \'f0
\'fd\u7907\'3fc khuy\u7871\'3fn kh\'edch v\u7853\'3ft ch\u7845\'3ft theo ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\u7873\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc b\u7843\'3fo qu\u7843\'3fn, gi\u7919\'3f g}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ecn v\'e0 s
\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng c\'f3 hi\u7879\'3fu qu\u7843\'3f m\u7885\'3fi t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f }{\f278\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh hi\u7879\'3fn c\'f3 c\u7911\'3fa x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp.}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid8272184 

