\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \u7903\'3f t\u7915\'3fng t\u7893\'3f, \'f0\u7897\'3fi s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft, t\u7915\'3fng ph\'e2n x\'fd\u7903\'3fng v\'e0 trong to
