\par - C\'f4ng su\u7845\'3ft m\'e1y m\'f3c thi\u7871\'3ft b\u7883\'3f th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc huy \'f0\u7897\'3fng;
\par - Th\u7901\'3fi gian ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f c\u7911\'3fa m\'e1y m\'f3c thi\u7871\'3ft b\u7883\'3f v\'e0 th\u7901\'3fi gian ng\u7915\'3fng vi\u7879\'3fc theo c\'e1c nguy\'ean nh\'e2n;
\par - Nhi\'ean li\u7879\'3fu v\'e0 \'f0\u7897\'3fng l}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \u7921\'3fc ti\'eau hao ...;
