nh c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng t\u7893\'3f, \'f0\u7897\'3fi, ph\'e2n x\'fd\u7903\'3fng v\'e0 x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp do t\u7915\'3fng x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh ph\'f9 h\u7907\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi \'f0\u7863\'3fc \'f0i\u7875\'3fm s\u7917\'3f d
\u7909\'3fng v\'e0 y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'fd t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f }{\f278\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \u7903\'3f m\u7895\'3fi x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp (ph\u7909
