\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f2n v\'e0 gi\u7843\'3fm v\u7889\'3fn c\u7889\'3f }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh. X\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc gi\u7919\'3f l\u7841\'3fi s\u7889\'3f kh\u7845\'3f
u hao c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f b\u7893\'3f sung v\'e0o qu\u7929\'3f khuy\u7871\'3fn kh\'edch ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft, ho\u7863\'3fc qu\u7929\'3f chuy\'ean d\'f9ng c\u7911\'3fa x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp. Khi chuy\u7875\'3f
n kho\u7843\'3fn kh\u7845\'3fu hao n\'e0y v\'e0o qu\u7929\'3f, k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n ghi gi\u7843\'3fm t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn kh\u7845\'3fu hao (kh\u7845\'3fu hao c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn) v\'e0 ghi t\'e3ng t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn c\'e1c qu\u7929\'3f x
