\'3fc t\u7853\'3fp h\u7907\'3fp ghi ch\'e9p tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp v\'e0o s\u7893\'3f s\'e1ch k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n chi ph\'ed s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft v\'e0 t\'ednh gi\'e1 th\'e0nh m\u7903\'3f cho c\'f4ng tr}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ecnh, }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \'f0\'f3.}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid8272184 
\par }{\b\f278\fs28\expnd4\expndtw24\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 49 -}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754  Khi c\'f4ng tr\'ecnh s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn ho\'e0n th\'e0nh, x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp ph}{
\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \u7843\'3fi l\'e0m th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc nghi\u7879\'3fm thu v\'e0 l\u7853\'3fp bi\'ean b\u7843\'3fn giao nh\u7853\'3fn t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899
\'3fn ho\'e0n th\'e0nh theo m\u7851\'3fu quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc (ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f ghi ch\'e9p ban \'f0\u7847\'3fu).
\par Bi\'ean b\u7843\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc l\u7853\'3fp hai b\u7843\'3fn c\'f3 ch\u7919\'3f k}{\f278\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'fd c\u7911\'3fa ban nghi\u7879\'3fm thu, c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\u7841\'3fi di\u7879\'3fn \'f0}{
\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f5n v\u7883\'3f s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa v\'e0 c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\u7841\'3fi di\u7879\'3fn \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f c\'f3 t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa. Bi\'ean b
\u7843\'3fn sau khi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng k}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'fd x\'e1c nh\u7853\'3fn v\'e0 gi\'e1m }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\u7889\'3fc x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp duy
\u7879\'3ft y, m\u7897\'3ft b\u7843\'3fn giao cho \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f nh\u7853\'3fn s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa gi\u7919\'3f, m\u7897\'3ft b\u7843\'3fn giao cho \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f c\'f3 t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7917\'3fa ch
\u7919\'3fa gi\u7919\'3fa \'f0\u7875\'3f ghi ch\'e9p nh\u7919\'3fng \'f0i\u7873\'3fu c\u7847\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft v\'e0o s\u7893\'3f t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\'e0 sau \'f0\'f3 chuy\u7875\'3fn v\u7873\'3f ph}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f2ng k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp. C}{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o bi\'ean b\u7843\'3fn giao nh\u7853\'3fn t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3f
nh s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn ho\'e0n th\'e0nh, k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n ghi gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh ho\'e0n th\'e0nh \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc duy\u7879\'3ft y v\'e0
o th\u7867\'3f t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh, x\u7871\'3fp th\u7867\'3f t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7915\'3f ng\'e3n th\u7867\'3f t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \'f0ang s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3f
a l\u7899\'3fn v\'e0o ng\'e3n th\u7867\'3f t\'fd\'f5ng \u7913\'3fng trong h}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f2m th\u7867\'3f, }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\u7891\'3fng th\u7901\'3fi ghi gi\u7843\'3fm ngu\u7891\'3fn v
\u7889\'3fn s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh.}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid8272184 
\par }{\b\f278\fs28\expnd4\expndtw24\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 50-}{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754  K\u7871\'3f to\'e1n chi ph\'ed s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c
\u7847\'3fn ph\'e2n bi\u7879\'3ft m\u7845\'3fy tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp sau:
\par - Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp c\'f4ng vi\u7879\'3fc s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh do c\'e1c b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft ph\u7909\'3f, x\'e2y l\u7855\'3fp ph\u7909\'3f
 ho\u7863\'3fc do ph\'e2n x\'fd\u7903\'3fng s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft ch\'ednh c\u7911\'3fa x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp t\u7921\'3f l\'e0m th}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ec to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f chi ph\'ed th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f ph\'e1
t sinh trong qu\'e1 tr\'ecnh s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\u7853\'3fp h\u7907\'3fp v\'e0o t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft ph\u7909\'3f, x\'e2y l\u7855\'3fp ph\u7909\'3f ho
\u7863\'3fc s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft ch\'ednh. Gi}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'e1 th\'e0nh th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f c\u7911\'3fa c\'f4ng tr\'ecnh s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn ho\'e0n th\'e0nh }{
\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n t\u7915\'3f t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft ph\u7909\'3f, x\'e2y l\u7855\'3fp ph\u7909\'3f ho\u7863\'3fc s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft ch\'ednh v\'e0o t
\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ti\'eau th\u7909\'3f, \'f0\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f \'f0\'e2y k\u7871\'3ft chuy\u7875\'3fn ghi gi\u7843\'3fm ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn.
\par - Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp s\u7917\'3fa  ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh theo ph\'fd\'f5ng ph\'e1p cho th\u7847\'3fu th}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ec c\'e1c chi ph
\'ed th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f v\u7873\'3f s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn (s\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn ph\u7843\'3fi thanh to\'e1n v\u7899\'3fi }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f nh\u7853\'3fn th\u7847\'3fu) \'f0
\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n v\'e0o t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn. C\'e1c chi ph\'ed li\'ean quan \'f0\u7871\'3fn vi\u7879\'3fc v\u7853\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \'f0i v
\'e0 v\u7873\'3f x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n v\'e0o chi ph\'ed s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft ho\u7863\'3fc chi ph\'ed l\'fdu th\'f4ng (kho\u7843\'3fn m\u7909\'3fc chi ph\'ed qu\u7843\'3fn l}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'fd).
\par }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 Gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f ph\u7871\'3f li\u7879\'3fu thu h\u7891\'3fi \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc trong qu\'e1 tr}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ecnh s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn t\'e0i s\u7843
\'3fn c\u7889\'3f }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ghi gi\u7843\'3fm chi ph\'ed th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f v\u7873\'3f s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3f
nh.}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid8272184 
\par }{\b\f278\fs28\expnd4\expndtw24\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 51-}{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754  \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c chi ph\'ed s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f 
\'f0\u7883\'3fnh cho thu\'ea, th}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ec tu\u7923\'3f theo h\u7907\'3fp }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\u7891\'3fng quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\'e0 k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n nh\'fd sau:
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 N\u7871\'3fu chi ph\'ed s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn do b\'ean cho thu\'ea ch\u7883\'3fu th\'ec b\'ean cho thu\'ea ph\u7843\'3fi t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n nh}{
\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'fd quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \u7903\'3f \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 50 tr\'ean \'f0\'e2y.
\par N\u7871\'3fu chi ph\'ed s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn do b\'ean \'f0i thu\'ea ch\u7883\'3fu th}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ec b\'ean }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0i thu\'ea ph\u7843\'3fi c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f
 v\'e0o d\u7921\'3f to\'e1n chi ph\'ed s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn ph\u7843\'3fi ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh m\'e0 tr\'edch tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc h\'e0ng th\'e1ng m\u7897\'3ft kho\u7843\'3fn nh\u7845\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n v\'e0o t
\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn chi ph\'ed tr\'edch tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 t\'ednh v\'e0o chi ph\'ed c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh thu\'ea ngo\'e0i.
\par Khi ti\u7871\'3fn h\'e0nh s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \'f0i thu\'ea, to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f chi ph\'ed th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f v\u7873\'3f s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa tu\u7923\'3f theo t\u7915\'3f
ng tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f m\'e0 h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n nh\'fd quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 50. Khi c\'f4ng vi\u7879\'3fc s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn ho\'e0n th\'e0nh, chi ph\'ed th\u7921
\'3fc t\u7871\'3f v\u7873\'3f s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc k\u7871\'3ft chuy\u7875\'3fn v\'e0o t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn chi ph\'ed tr\'edch tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc. Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp chi ph\'ed th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f
 c\u7911\'3fa c\'f4ng vi\u7879\'3fc s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh thu\'ea ngo\'e0i nhi\u7873\'3fu h\'f5n s\u7889\'3f tr\'edch tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc th}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ec
 ph\u7843\'3fi tr\'edch th\'eam cho }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\u7911\'3f v\'e0 t\'ednh v\'e0o chi ph\'ed c\u7911\'3fa b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh th\'e1ng 
\'f0\'f3. Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp s\u7889\'3f tr\'edch tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc nhi\u7873\'3fu h\'f5n s\u7889\'3f chi ph\'ed th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f v\u7873\'3f s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn th}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ec
 }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ch\u7881\'3fnh b\u7857\'3fng m\u7921\'3fc \'f0\u7887\'3f \'f0\u7875\'3f gi\u7843\'3fm s\u7889\'3f chi ph\'ed tr\'edch tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'e3
 t\'ednh v\'e0o chi ph\'ed c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f }{\f278\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh.
\par }{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 Khi b\'e0n giao t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh cho x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp cho thu\'ea, x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp thu\'ea t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh ph\u7843\'3fi th\'f4ng b
\'e1o cho x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp cho thu\'ea bi\u7871\'3ft s\u7889\'3f chi ph\'ed s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn ho\'e0n th\'e0nh \'f0\u7875\'3f l\'e0m c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f ghi s\u7893\'3f, th\u7867\'3f t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3f
nh.}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid8272184 
\par }{\b\f278\fs28\expnd4\expndtw24\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 52.}{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754  Chi ph\'ed s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \'f0
\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\'ednh v\'e0o chi ph\'ed s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft ho\u7863\'3fc chi ph\'ed l\'fdu th\'f4ng h\'e0ng th\'e1ng.
\par Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp vi\u7879\'3fc s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean kh\'f4ng \'f0\u7873\'3fu \'f0\u7863\'3fn gi\u7919\'3fa c\'e1c th\'e1ng l\'e0m cho gi\'e1 th\'e0nh s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm ho\u7863\'3fc chi ph\'ed l
\'fdu th\'f4ng cao h\u7841\'3f th\u7845\'3ft th\'fd\u7901\'3fng th}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ec x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng ph}{\f286\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'fd\'f5ng ph\'e1p tr\'ed
ch tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc m\u7897\'3ft m\u7913\'3fc nh\u7845\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh chi ph\'ed s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh. S\u7889\'3f tr\'edch tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc h\'e0ng th\'e1ng \'f0
\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n v\'e0o t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn chi ph\'ed tr\'edch tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 ph\'e2n ph\u7889\'3fi v\'e0o c\'e1c t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn chi ph\'ed s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft ho\u7863\'3fc chi ph\'ed l\'fdu th\'f4ng li\'ea
n quan. To\'e0n b\u7897\'3f chi ph\'ed s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f ph\'e1t sinh trong n\'e3m ph\u7843\'3fi t\'ednh h\u7871\'3ft v\'e0o chi ph\'ed s\u7843
\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft ho\u7863\'3fc chi ph\'ed l\'fdu th\'f4ng c\u7911\'3fa n\'e3m \'f0\'f3. V}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'ec v\u7853\'3fy }{\f278\fs28\cf0\insrsid4667741\charrsid150754 \'f0\u7871\'3fn cu\u7889\'3fi n}{
