c gi\u7843\'3fm chi ph\'ed s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft ho\u7863\'3fc chi ph\'ed l\'fdu th\'f4ng trong n\'e3m b\'e1o c\'e1o.
\par Vi\u7879\'3fc h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n chi ph\'ed s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa th\'fd\u7901\'3fng xuy\'ean t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh thu\'ea ngo\'e0i \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn nh\'fd vi\u7879\'3fc h\u7841\'3fch to
